         corner of every screen in WADEPS

If either the Supervisor Dashboard button is missing or Approve Records Privilege is not shown or
displays No, you do not currently have access to review records.

   Need Help?

    If you believe you should have access or need help with permissions, please contact your
    designated agency contact.

