Reporting No Reportable Use of Force Events for the Month

Agencies can report no reportable UOF events for the month in the “Report Month with no Use of
Forceˮ section located at the bottom of the supervisor dashboard.
Select the month in “Select Monthˮ and click the “Confirm no UOFˮ button.

When the “Confirm no UOFˮ button is selected, a message will confirm the submission in the
WADEPS system.

    Agencies must report no uses of force by the 5th of every month.
         If no uses of force occurred in September, the agency must report “No Uses of Forceˮ by
         October 5th.

